           TestSuite "Tests du programme de paie PAYROL00"

           TestCase "INITIALIZATION remplit le nom"
           PERFORM INITIALIZATION
           EXPECT WHO TO BE "Captain COBOL"

           TestCase "INITIALIZATION remplit les heures et le taux"
           PERFORM INITIALIZATION
           EXPECT HOURS TO BE 19
           EXPECT RATE TO BE 23

           TestCase "COMPUTE-GROSS-PAY : 19 heures x 23 = 437"
           MOVE 19 TO HOURS
           MOVE 23 TO RATE
           PERFORM COMPUTE-GROSS-PAY
           EXPECT GROSS-PAY TO BE 437

           TestCase "COMPUTE-GROSS-PAY : 0 heure donne 0"
           MOVE 0 TO HOURS
           MOVE 50 TO RATE
           PERFORM COMPUTE-GROSS-PAY
           EXPECT GROSS-PAY TO BE 0

           TestCase "COMPUTE-GROSS-PAY : 40 heures x 100 = 4000"
           MOVE 40 TO HOURS
           MOVE 100 TO RATE
           PERFORM COMPUTE-GROSS-PAY
           EXPECT GROSS-PAY TO BE 4000
